<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Aug producer price rise slows to 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Aug producer price rise slows to 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The monthly rise in Ukraine's producer prices slowed to 0.4 percent in August from 0.6 percent in July, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE PRODUCER PRICES   Aug 96   July 96   Aug 95</p>
<p>    mth/mth			 +0.4     +0.6	+6.5</p>
<p>Producer prices have risen 13.1 percent so far this year compared to 113.6 percent for the same period last year. --Natalya Zinets, Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
